{"last_link_id": 10, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}, {"name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "size": [270, 290.00006103515625], "pos": [5094.1806640625, 3415.814697265625], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 8, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "id": 9, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [8], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [274.080078125, 314.00006103515625], "pos": [4776.130859375, 3420.635498046875], "widgets_values": ["69cd9ca470f85b2ec274f1eac6f6bfee95787986d680ed965c6e221975669161.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 8, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#f4aa14", "widgets_values": ["# Usage: Package and upload segmented audio of about 5 minutes; then click Run to start training. After training completes, a txt document will be generated. Manually download the trained model via the download link provided in the document.\n# -FAQ:\n## [Q:For the 5-minute audio to upload, how long is each segment? Should it be raw human speech audio?](1)\n## --A: The total duration is around 5 minutes. It does not need to be a single continuous clip. Multiple segments can be combined, with each segment ranging from several seconds to one or two minutes. All audio must come from the same speaker, be raw vocal audio with consistent volume. Clean raw vocals: no BGM, no reverb, no overlapping voices from multiple people. Regular speaking voice works; if singing inference is needed later, raw singing vocals will yield better results. The workflow enables auto_extract_vocals. Vocals can be separated from audio with accompaniment, yet the outcome is inferior to using raw vocals directly.\n## [Q:Can I mix Mandarin and Cantonese in the audio?](1)\n## A: Yes. The RVC model in this workflow learns timbre rather than language. Mixed recordings of Mandarin and Cantonese are acceptable, provided all audio is from the same person.\n## Q:[Audio format? Compression mode and file name?](1)\n## A: Standard \".wav\" is fine. It is recommended to record audio using Capcut, then normalize the volume and remove noise. Export the files in segments named s1, s2......Sn, and then package them into \".zip\" format"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#e09600", "size": [867.7882690429688, 442.9912414550781], "pos": [395.3789367675781, -552.3067626953125], "id": 12, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#f4aa14", "widgets_values": ["# 用法：打包上传约5分钟的分段音频；然后点击运行，开始训练。训练完后生成txt文档，根据文档里提供的训练好的模型的下载地址，手动去下载。\n# -答疑：\n## --Q:[上传的5分钟的声音，是多长一段？人普通说话的干声吗？](1)\n## --A:合计约 5 分钟，不是必须一整段。可以多段拼起来，每段几秒到一两分钟都行。同一个人、干声、音量一致。干净干声：无BGM、无混响、无多人叠音。普通说话可以；如果以后要唱歌，用唱歌干声更好。工作流开了 auto_extract_vocals，带伴奏也能抽人声，但效果不如直接上干声。\n## --Q:[可以普通话，粤语混合起来说吗？](1)\n## A:可以。本工作流的RVC 模型，学的是音色，不是语言。普通话、粤语混录没问题，必须同一个人\n## --Q:[音频格式？和压缩模式、文件名？](1)\n## A:普通wav即可。推荐用剪映录音，然后把音量统一并去噪。然后分段导出为s1,s2......Sn，然后打包成\".zip\"格式在下面节点上传，点击运行即可。\n#  [最后，下载训练好的模型，大约50-80mb，到另一个工作流里使用，即可用你的声音翻唱一切歌曲!](1)"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#e09600", "size": [918.655029296875, 434.2727661132812